  "description": "Compute elementwise addition of two identically shaped 2D matrices.\n\n**Mathematical Formulation:**\n\n$$\nC_{ij} = A_{ij} + B_{ij}\n$$\n\n**Step-by-Step Implementation:**\n1. Verify matching row and column dimensions.\n2. Add corresponding matrix entries element by element.\n3. Return summed matrix.\n\n**Returns:** 2D list of summed values.",
  "examples": [
    "Input: x = [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]\nOutput: result matching Matrix Addition specification."
